This file holds the intended custom domain for GitHub Pages once DNS for
`netriq.ai` flips off the demo VMS cluster (currently at Hetzner 5.223.63.207).

To restore: `git mv CNAME.pending CNAME`, commit, push. Pages will pick it up
on the next build. Verify with:

  curl -I https://netriq.ai/

See also: .github/workflows/dns-cutover-nudge.yml (the weekly check that
notices when DNS flips and stops nagging).
